<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Good morning, everyone! I'm back with some macros for farming X-Antibody for sustaining the X evolution.

First, make sure you have an X-evolution with strong attack damage. Craniumon X is a good example, Examon X is another. You will most likely need a Critical Damage (100%) plugin card so you can fast kill any digi. If you are not strong enough, feel free to edit this macro and change the "1" with skill "F1".

Also, don't forget to put the X-Antibody on F5 so it will keep the X bar going.

So, in order to get the best from this macro, I recommend going to Versandi Terminal, Nanomon place, and go to the back, where you will have 4/5 Nanomons respawning constantly. You wont get exhaustion points, so you won't be reported!

Any doubts, feel free to contact me! Have a good farming!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64 ms
GoWhile 1 200
KeyDown 62 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 62 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>